  - Julia
abstract: >-
  A self-contained Julia verification laboratory for the AB-Cloud research
  program: lattice Aharonov-Bohm vortex Hamiltonians whose spectra are audited
  against the GUE universal statistics of the Riemann zeta zeros. Includes the
  SUPERCOMBO 38-test suite (ab_cloud_v23_v2), the compact HP·MERIDIAN H1–H7
  gate audit with the 40-solve budget and FOCUS-D mode, the RH correlation
  sweeps with 13 661 real zeta zeros, the Monumental V01–V112 verification
  battery, and the honestly recalibrated Anderson–Darling Test 11.
